class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/Run_up_a_tree_to_the_moon.\" title=\"Run up a tree to the moon.\">Run up a tree to the moon.</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/Slap_and_tong.\" title=\"Slap and tong.\">Slap and tong.</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><b>Premature conker.</b></i> is the fourth episode of <a href=\"/wiki/Series_11\" title=\"Series 11\">Series 11</a> of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster\" title=\"Taskmaster\">Taskmaster</a></i> and was first broadcast on <a href=\"/wiki/Channel_4\" title=\"Channel 4\">Channel 4</a> on 8 April 2021. The episode was won by <a href=\"/wiki/Sarah_Kendall\" title=\"Sarah Kendall\">Sarah Kendall</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Episode_title\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode title</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Alternate_titles\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Alternate titles</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Episode_breakdown\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode breakdown</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#External_links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External links</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_title\">Episode title</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode title\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Premature_conker.?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode title\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>\"Premature conker\" was one of the things that <a href=\"/wiki/Mike_Wozniak\" title=\"Mike Wozniak\">Mike Wozniak</a> guessed he had found under the table in the <a href=\"/wiki/Write_down_what_five_things_are_in_the_bowl_under_the_table\" title=\"Write down what five things are in the bowl under the table\">Write down what five things are in the bowl under the table</a> task. The title card shows a banana like the one used in the <a href=\"/wiki/Get_all_of_this_banana_in_the_bottle\" title=\"Get all of this banana in the bottle\">Get all of this banana in the bottle</a> task.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Alternate_titles\">Alternate titles</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Premature_conker.?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>On Denmark's TV2 Play streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Umoden kastanje', which translates as 'Premature chestnut'.</li>\n<li>On Finland's MTV Katsomo streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Ennenaikainen hevoskastanja', which translates as 'Premature horse-chestnut'.</li>\n<li>On Sweden's SVT Play streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Full rulle med toarulle', which translates as 'Full roll with loo roll'. This is a reference to the <a href=\"/wiki/Get_this_sheet_of_loo_roll_as_far_from_here_as_possible\" title=\"Get this sheet of loo roll as far from here as possible\">Get this sheet of loo roll as far from here as possible</a> task. 'Full rulle' is a Swedish expression meaning 'full speed', but also refers to a full toilet roll, in this context.</li>\n<li>On Norway's Discovery+ Norge streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Umoden kastanje', which translates as 'Premature conker'. Note: this Norwegian translation of the title only appears in the subtitles for the episode, whereas the episode title listed on the platform is the original English title.<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_breakdown\">Episode breakdown</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Premature_conker.?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mbox\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">Spoilers!</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-spoilers\">This section contains spoilers.</div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-spoilers\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<table class=\"tmtable\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"tmtableheader\">\n<th>Task\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Charlotte_Ritchie\" title=\"Charlotte Ritchie\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Charlotte Ritchie</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Jamali_Maddix\" title=\"Jamali Maddix\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Jamali Maddix</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Lee_Mack\" title=\"Lee Mack\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Lee Mack</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Mike_Wozniak\" title=\"Mike Wozniak\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Mike Wozniak</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Sarah_Kendall\" title=\"Sarah Kendall\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Sarah Kendall</span></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Craziest_thing\" title=\"Craziest thing\">1</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Prize:</b> Craziest thing.\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Get_all_of_this_banana_in_the_bottle\" title=\"Get all of this banana in the bottle\">2</a>\n</td>\n<td>Get all of the banana in the bottle. You may not break the bottle. The bottle may not leave the lab.\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Put_the_bag_of_salt_on_that_table_over_there\" title=\"Put the bag of salt on that table over there\">3</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Team:</b> Put the bag of salt on that table over there. No one may move whilst holding the bag of salt. If the bag of salt touches the ground at any point, you must return to your starting point. If any bell touches the ground at any point, you must return to your starting point. You may not touch the rope or your belts.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Get_this_sheet_of_loo_roll_as_far_from_here_as_possible\" title=\"Get this sheet of loo roll as far from here as possible\">4</a>\n</td>\n<td>Get this sheet of loo roll as far from here as possible. Only this sheet of loo roll may touch the ground. The loo roll must not break at any point and the loo roll inner tube must stay on the loo roll holder at all times.\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Write_down_what_five_things_are_in_the_bowl_under_the_table\" title=\"Write down what five things are in the bowl under the table\">5</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Live:</b> Write down what five things are in the bowl under the table and how many of each thing there are. You must look at the Taskmaster throughout this task. One of your hands must be in the bowl and the other must be holding your pen throughout the task.\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtabletotal\">\n<th colspan=\"2\">Total\n</th>\n<td>13\n</td>\n<td>21\n</td>\n<td>7\n</td>\n<td>6\n</td>\n<td class=\"tmtablewinner\"><b>23</b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: External links\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=